  "caption": "Job DNA scores each resume branch against the target posting.\n\nJobRez maintains one master resume, where branches are copies tailored per role. Each branch is scored against the posting in Job DNA.\n\nRole match is deterministic through a curated technology taxonomy with aliases, whole-word matching, required terms weighted double and preferred terms once, with no cloud AI and no external verification.\n\nBuild your master resume at jobrez.com.",
